{"title":"25","section":"1771a","heading":"Omitted","lead":"","tree":[],"notes":[{"topic":"editorialNotes","text":"Editorial Notes"},{"topic":"codification","text":"Codification Section, Pub. L. 100–95, § 3, Aug. 18, 1987, 101 Stat. 704, which related to the Gay Head Indian claims settlement fund, was omitted from the Code as being of special and not general application."}],"sourceCredit":"","releasePoint":"119-102","ancestors":[{"type":"title","num":"Title 25—","heading":"INDIANS","identifier":"/us/usc/t25"},{"type":"chapter","num":"CHAPTER 19—","heading":"INDIAN LAND CLAIMS SETTLEMENTS","identifier":"/us/usc/t25/ch19"},{"type":"subchapter","num":"SUBCHAPTER V—","heading":"MASSACHUSETTS INDIAN LAND CLAIMS SETTLEMENT","identifier":"/us/usc/t25/ch19/schV"}]}